/Title (For years, you were the girl who was always running. You measured your worth in milestones, in grades, in the constant pursuit of the next academic crest. Momentum was your safety net. As long as you were moving, you didn't have to ask yourself where you were actually going. Now the track has vanished, leaving you in an open, undefined field. The silence of this new freedom is deafening, and the pressure to map out a flawless career feels heavier than any final examination.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1832 0 R
/Prev 1867 0 R
/Next 1908 0 R
>>
endobj
1888 0 obj
<<
