/Title (I know why you always pushed yourself so hard. You thought being the best was the only way to be seen, the only way to make your parents proud, and the only way to prove that you were worthy of love. You carried those heavy demands silently, turning pressure into motivation even when the well inside you had run dry. Every high grade and every compliment became a lifeline you clung to, terrified that slowing down would mean letting everyone fall.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1864 0 R
/Prev 1883 0 R
/Next 1921 0 R
>>
endobj
1905 0 obj
<<
/Title (The pressure that once felt like a constant shadow will lose its power. You will find your own path, at your own pace, and it will be worth every heartbreak and every detour. So, I watch you now and wish you would be gentler with yourself. You do not have to earn your right to exist through constant success. Your future is not being ruined by these setbacks; it is being built by them.)
/Dest [19 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 1864 0 R
/Prev 1922 0 R
/Next 1884 0 R
>>
